        <mxCell id="card-0-5" value="Both images keep the product central. The desktop side&lt;br&gt;controls are subdued and the mobile consent overlay&lt;br&gt;obscures much of the lower screen. The current link&lt;br&gt;provided no verified dashboard flow." style="html=1;text;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=17;fontColor=#3D4560;fontStyle=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="card-0">
